@crew v-aalto-talia
// Writer 4, batch 5: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hey! Talia Aalto, charts office. I map people, really. Who's where. You?
- Hello there! Is the lounge always this cosy? I'm moving in.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}! You're on my map now. Deck 4, a bunk. Am I right?   #funny
?

== chat
- I buy one thing from every ship's store. Here, it was a tiny tin of mints.
- Lounges tell you everything about a ship. Yours says: tea, Tiles, and a good view.

== near
? place:crew_store
- Souvenir hunting. One thing. Small. Ooh, that's nice.
? place:lounge
- Who's that by the bar? No, don't tell me. I'll guess. I'm good at this.   #funny
?

== bye
- {bye}! Come and find me in the lounge. Everyone does.

== smalltalk
- Ooh, a new face.
- One souvenir. Just one.   #funny
